LinkedIn Job Automation

Overview

LinkedIn Job Automation is a Python-based tool designed to simplify and streamline the job search process. The project helps users discover relevant job opportunities, filter positions based on custom criteria, track applications, and improve efficiency in managing job applications.

Features

- Automated job search and filtering
- Resume-job matching analysis
- Custom keyword and location filters
- Application tracking and status management
- AI-powered job relevance scoring
- CSV and Excel export support
- Configurable search preferences

Technologies Used

- Python
- Selenium
- Pandas
- OpenAI API
- BeautifulSoup
- Requests
- SQLite
- Jupyter Notebook

